[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0319","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0319.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0825","title":"xinetd xinetd 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"漏洞存在于xinetd版本2.1.8.8之前的内部字符串处理例程中。当攻击者向目标系统发送包含恶意长度参数的数据包时，该漏洞会导致整数溢出和长度检查失效，这是由于程序在处理用户输入的长度参数时缺乏有效验证。受影响的版本包括xinetd 2.1.8.8之前的版本，是广泛应用于Linux系统的网络服务守护程序，影响了多种Linux发行版上的服务器和工作站。该漏洞的攻击条件非常宽松，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程触发，只需向目标系统发送包含恶意长度参数的数据包即可。这种缺陷导致攻击者可以通过缓冲区溢出攻击在目标系统上执行任意代码，完全破坏系统的机密性、完整性和可用性，严重威胁系统的安全运行。攻击者利用精心构造的恶意数据包来触发漏洞，该数据包通过禁用长度检查机制诱使xinetd调用其内部的字符串处理函数，最终导致内存缓冲区溢出。通过溢出攻击，攻击者可以在目标系统上注入任意代码并获得完全控制权限，使系统处于攻击者的掌控之下。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0825"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:01.847","remediation":"tags.<value>建议立即升级 xinetd 至 2.1.8.8 或更高版本（当前最新 2.3.15+），具体操作：1) Red Hat 系执行 `yum update xinetd`，Debian/Ubuntu 执行 `apt-get install --only-upgrade xinetd`；2) 参考 RHSA-2001-092、Conectiva CLA-2001:406、Immunix IMNX-2001-70-029-01 应用官方补丁；3) 无法立即升级时，用 iptables 限制 xinetd 监听端口仅允许受信 IP 访问，并禁用不必要的内置服务（如 telnet、ftp）；4) 检查 /etc/xinetd.conf 与 /etc/xinetd.d/ 下配置，确保 `only_from`、`no_access` 正确设置访问控制。该漏洞 CVSS 10.0，远程无需认证即可 RCE，务必优先修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000406","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-029-01","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-092.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2971","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6804","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0825.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0825","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0825.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0825.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w38q-jf8r-5q4w/GHSA-w38q-jf8r-5q4w.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0825.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_700_800.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-130.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0825.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--749bd0a1-2a49-4a0b-bc99-c591ec52151d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0319.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0318","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0318.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0819","title":"Linux fetchmail 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Linux fetchmail 5.8.6 之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标邮件服务器发送一个包含超长 \"To:\" 字段的特制电子邮件头触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而在受影响系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 fetchmail 全系早期版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，可能造成敏感信息泄露、系统完整性破坏及服务可用性下降。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0819"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:00.947","remediation":"立即升级 fetchmail 至 5.8.6 或更高版本。若无法升级，可配置邮件过滤规则拦截含有超长 To: 字段的邮件头，或在边界邮件网关层限制邮件头字段长度不超过 4096 字节。对于使用 fetchmail 转发的内部网络，可暂时改用其他邮件转发代理（如 getmail）替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000403","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-025-01","http://www.caldera.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-022.1.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-060","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-063.php3?dis=7.1","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1451.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_026_fetchmail_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-103.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2877","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6704","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0819.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0819.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0819","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-mj8x-p695-m8mc/GHSA-mj8x-p695-m8mc.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-060.nasl","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0819.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0819.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-060.data","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2986d1ae-55c9-4083-8a3d-9c6d6b139d22.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0318.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0317","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0317.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0816","title":"OpenSSH sftp-server 受限命令绕过漏洞","description":"OpenSSH 2.9.9 之前版本存在安全绕过漏洞。该漏洞源于 sftp-server 在使用受限密钥对（restricted keypairs）时，未能正确执行 authorized_keys2 文件中配置的 command= 命令限制策略。经过身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 sftp 命令绕过这些预设的命令执行约束，从而在目标系统上执行未授权操作。攻击条件为攻击者需拥有有效的 SSH 认证凭据（如已泄露的私钥），并连接启用了 authorized_keys2 命令限制的 OpenSSH 服务。此漏洞影响所有使用 OpenSSH 2.9.9 之前版本且配置了密钥命令限制的系统，可能导致权限提升和未授权命令执行。建议立即升级至 OpenSSH 2.9.9 或更高版本以修复此安全缺陷。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0816"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:00.433","remediation":"升级 OpenSSH 至 2.9.9 或更高版本（当前主流版本为 9.x，建议至少升级至 OpenSSH 8.0p1 以上）。若系统为 RHEL/CentOS，可通过 `yum update openssh-server` 或 `dnf update openssh-server` 完成升级；Debian/Ubuntu 系统执行 `apt-get update && apt-get install openssh-server`。若暂时无法升级，可在 sshd_config 中禁用 sftp 子系统（注释掉 `Subsystem sftp /usr/libexec/openssh/sftp-server`），或改用 chroot 沙箱模式运行 sftp 并限制用户可执行的命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-09/0153.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000431","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-034-01","http://www.osvdb.org/5536","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-154.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7634","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0816.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0816","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0816.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0816.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6gpw-hxc4-7rm4/GHSA-6gpw-hxc4-7rm4.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0816.md","https://github.com/djc/oxish/blob/bf64cf02d5e31a17e708d69e2e0f66422499f851/openssh-vulnerabilities.md","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/openssh_adv_option.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0816.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0317.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0316","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0316.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0722","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5/6 Cookie泄露与修改漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.5 和 6.0 版本存在 Cookie 处理漏洞（又称\"First Cookie Handling Vulnerability\"）。该漏洞原理在于浏览器对 `about:` 协议 URL 中的 JavaScript 执行缺乏适当的安全隔离，攻击者可构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 `about:` URL，绕过同源策略限制，从而读取或篡改用户的 Cookie 信息。攻击条件为：受害者使用受影响版本的 Internet Explorer 浏览器访问攻击者精心构造的恶意网页或链接，无需任何身份认证即可触发。利用方式是通过嵌入 `about:` URL 的 JavaScript 脚本访问其他域名的 Cookie 数据，导致敏感会话信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 6.4，影响 Internet Explorer 5.5 和 6.0 版本，属于中等危害等级的安全缺陷。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0722"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:50.227","remediation":"升级至 Internet Explorer 6.0 SP1 或更高版本，该补丁已包含在 IE 6.0 SP1 安全更新中。如仍在使用 IE 5.5，建议直接迁移至 IE 6.0 SP1 或更新的现代浏览器（如 Microsoft Edge、Google Chrome、Mozilla Firefox）。作为临时缓解措施，可在 Internet 选项 → 安全 → Internet 区域中将 JavaScript 禁用或设置为\"提示\"，并启用\"检查网站服务器证书吊销\"及受限制的安全区域策略。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100527618108521&w=2","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/m-016.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/1982","http://www