程发送无效的RDP（远程桌面协议）数据包，触发协议解析错误导致系统拒绝服务，影响 Windows NT/2000 操作系统。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程实施攻击，攻击复杂度低，可能导致系统服务不可用。漏洞影响Windows NT/2000 操作系统版本，CVSS评分5.3，危害等级中度。目前已知存在多个PoC工具，可用于测试该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0663"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:42.630","remediation":"紧急安装 Windows XP/2003 安全更新包，包括 KB825119 及后续 RDP 服务补丁，建议通过 Windows Update 自动更新。如需立即缓解，可通过防火墙禁用 3389 端口并启用网络级别 RDP 速率限制。配置策略：限制 RDP 连接数和会话超时时间至默认值 10 分钟。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3445","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-052","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7302","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21123","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0663.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0663.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0663","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0663.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0663.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9gm3-f4rm-2qfw/GHSA-9gm3-f4rm-2qfw.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0663.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0282.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0214","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0214.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0550","title":"WU-FTPD 2.6.1 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"这是一个针对 wu-ftpd 2.6.1 的远程命令执行漏洞。该漏洞源于 FTP 服务器的 glob 函数（ftpglob）在处理特定的“~{\"”字符串时出现缺陷，攻击者可以构造恶意输入绕过验证直接执行系统命令。影响范围包括所有运行 wu-ftpd 2.6.1 的 FTP 服务器，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程触发，从网络连接开始，通过精心构造的参数触发堆溢出或直接执行命令，以达到完全控制服务器的目的。导致服务器被入侵、数据泄露或进一步横向移动。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，反映其网络可达性低、攻击复杂性低、无需认证、并可能引发局部完整性泄露和破坏。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0550"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-11-30T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:30.757","remediation":"升级 Wu-FTPD 服务到 2.6.2 或更高版本，从源代码重新编译以应用所有安全补丁并关闭危险的 glob 功能。编辑 /etc/inetd.conf 或ftp服务器的配置文件，禁用不必要的高危命令（如 CWD、PASSIVE 模式）并限制服务网络访问权限。如无法立即升级，可配置防火墙规则阻止对FTP端口的异常连接，并限制用户权限以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000442","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-036-01","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100700363414799&w=2","http://www.caldera.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-041.0.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-33.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-087","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/886083","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-090.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_043_wuftpd_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-157.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/82/180823","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3581","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX0107-162","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7611","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21161","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0550.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/4a0cf863db8d2032b534fdeb22ed679473499848/2001/CVE-2001-0550.json","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/ec88907fa03ae5d9163ffc30448cd6735b4078ed/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Linux/Exploit/CVE-2001-0550.yara","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0935.md","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/Linux/CVE-2001-0550/Exploit_Linux_CVE-2001-0550_A_xp.yar","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2001/CVE-2001-0550.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0550.json","https://github.com/mudongliang/LinuxFlaw/blob/7738b4e61bddf979fe10215125da19bcb99d2318/CVE-2001-0550/README.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2001/CVE-2001-0550.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2001/CVE-2001-0550/README.md","https://github.com/gilberto47831/Network-Filesystem-Forensics"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0214.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0350","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0350.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0935","title":"华盛顿大学 wu-ftpd 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"wu-ftpd 2.6.0 及更早版本存在安全漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络向目标 FTP 服务发送特制数据包触发该漏洞。该漏洞与 CVE-2001-0550 中描述的 ftpglob 错误无关，攻击者无需任何凭据即可利用，成功利用后可导致部分机密性、完整性和可用性损失，可能造成远程命令执行或拒绝服务。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0935"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-11-28T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:15.593","remediation":"建议立即将 wu-ftpd 升级至 2.6.1 或更高版本，上游修复通过更新 glob.c 文件消除了缓冲区溢出风险。临时缓解措施：在防火墙层面限制 FTP 服务仅对可信来源开放，禁用不必要的匿名访问及 SITE EXEC 等危险命令；长期建议迁移至持续维护的 FTPServer（如 vsftpd 或 proftpd），避免继续使用已多年无安全更新的 wu-ftpd。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_043_wuftpd_txt.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0935.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0935.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0935","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc202af7c41ce1218ba7619eda84142fd5c7f1cf/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0935.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0935.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/wu_ftpd_glob.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0935.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/r3p3r/cve-search/blob/4ecae17dde3ae5f3ee873c1f01faa3cc8769b85d/sbin/db_mgmt_vendorstatements.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0350.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0396","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0396.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0875","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 文件下载安全警告绕过漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.5 与 6.0 存在文件下载安全警告绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可构造特制网页或下载链接，使“文件下载”对话框中显示的文件名或扩展名被错误呈现，从而误导用户将危险文件（如可执行程序）误认为安全类型并确认下载执行。该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击条件为网络可达且用户需主动确认下载；成功利用可导致恶意代码在用户系统中运行，造成信息泄露、篡改或可用性受损。CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高危，主要影响使用 IE 5.5/6.0 的 Windows 客户端环境。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0875"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-11-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:08.963","remediation":"立即安装微软安全公告 MS01-058 对应的累积补丁 KB313675，下载地址为 https://www.microsoft.com/windows/ie/downloads/critical/Q313675/default.asp。IE 5.5 用户安装后需重启浏览器，IE 6.0 Gold 用户可直接安装。如暂时无法打补丁，可在 IE 安全设置中将 Internet 区域和 Intranet 区域的「文件下载」功能禁用，作为临时缓解措施。长远建议升级至 IE 5.5 SP3 或 IE 6 SP1，该补丁已集成于这两个服务包中。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/245594","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3597","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-058","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7636","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1014","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/641","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d2be4eb036a20db5be632f5ca0ba66a631c4d156/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0875.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0875","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0875.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f59a7fbf5b47ecd49b181f13f4091ea609ec99d4/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0875.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_nt_ms02-005.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/458762a518138a26e597ac195eb82ce6c30238eb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6q67-2q8f-xvf4/GHSA-6q67-2q8f-xvf4.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-0875.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0875.json","https://github.com/andr