raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0411.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0409","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0409.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0909","title":"Microsoft Windows XP Help Center HCP URI 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows XP 的帮助中心程序 helpctr.exe 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送包含超长 hcp: URI 的特制请求，触发 helpctr.exe 中的缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows XP 操作系统，CVSS 评分为 7.5，属于高危级别。攻击条件宽松，仅需向目标发送恶意构造的 hcp 协议链接即可触发利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0909"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-11-21T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:12.457","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-060 对应的更新补丁，或升级至 Windows XP Service Pack 1 (SP1) 及以上版本。如无法安装补丁，可通过命令行运行 `regsvr32 /u %windir%\\pchealth\\helpctr\\binaries\\helpctr.exe` 注销 helpctr.exe 组件，或删除注册表中 `HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\\hcp` 协议处理项作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100638955422011&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6802","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7605","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22232","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c7415a52c8c7c49b12758f6cb68d7d41d1190b12/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0909.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0909","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1b90054999de26e10cbd417a0bad0a4c95c3a80e/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0909.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03565a27475d500737670f7247b6cadb2e7c3d33/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0909.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c64x-2qg4-rpqq/GHSA-c64x-2qg4-rpqq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0909.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151700_151800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b78cd9d1-2a13-43bd-a1d9-fe346abc1009.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0409.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0409.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0409.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0404","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0404.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0900","title":"Menalto Gallery modules.php 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Gallery 1.1 和 1.2 版本的 modules.php 文件存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 include 参数中注入 ../ 路径序列，突破 Web 根目录限制，读取服务器上的任意敏感文件（如配置文件或系统文件）。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击条件宽松，只要目标运行受影响版本的 Gallery 并暴露 HTTP 服务即可触发。攻击者仅需发送包含恶意路径的 HTTP 请求，即可实现任意文件读取，造成敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0900"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-11-18T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:11.293","remediation":"立即将 Gallery 升级至 1.2.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复 modules.php 中 include 参数未过滤目录遍历序列的问题。如暂时无法升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache）配置中添加 rewrite 规则或 PHP 配置 open_basedir 限制，禁止通过 URL 访问 /etc/passwd 等系统敏感文件，并手动审查 modules.php 中对 include 参数的处理逻辑，确保不接受 ../../ 类路径序列。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100619599000590&w=2","http://www.menalto.com/projects/gallery/article.php?sid=33&mode=&order=","http://www.osvdb.org/677","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3554","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7580","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21157","https://g